OL,3,GNEWSAJames Blunt to headline
OL,4,ASilverstone festival in 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe headline acts for two
OL,7,FNorthamptonshire festivals have been
OL,8,Fannounced.
OL,10,FCarFest 2027 said James Blunt, who
OL,11,Frecently appeared on The Celebrity
OL,12,FTraitors, will perform at Silverstone
OL,13,Falong with Jess Glynne and DJ Pete Tong
OL,14,Fon 27-29 August.
OL,16,FSupergrass will appear at Roseshire
OL,17,FFestival 2027, at Chester House Estate,
OL,18,FIrchester, on the same weekend.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
